#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_traj.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Step2**: 将 ROS2 Action 通信所需的接口功能包(fairino_sdk_server_interfaces)解压至上位机，通过 "
"colcon 构建工具编译，生成相应的消息、服务及动作类型。如下图1所示。"
msgstr ""
"**Step2**: decompress the interface function package required for  ROS2 "
"Action  communication to the host computer, compile it through the  colcon  "
"build tool, and generate the corresponding messages, service, and action "
"types. As shown in the following figure 1."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_traj.rst:-1
msgid "010.png"
msgstr "010.png"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_traj.rst:19
msgid "图表 4-1 编译接口功能包"
msgstr "Chart Compilation Interface Function Package 4-1 "

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_traj.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Step3**: 编译完成后，执行 source install/setup.bash 加载工作空间环境变量，使 ROS2 Action "
"接口类型在当前终端环境中可用。然后使用 ROS2 Action 接口向机器人下发控制指令，并接收执行结果。如下图2所示。"
msgstr ""
"**Step3**: After compilation, execute  source install/setup.bash  to load "
"the workspace environment variables, making the  ROS2 Action  interface type"
" available in the current terminal environment. Then use the  ROS2 Action  "
"interface to send control commands to the robot and receive execution "
"results. As shown in the following figure 2."

